This power reflects a Force user''s capacity to manipulate the living energy in things around him. It is the individual''s choice, however, whether to use this gift to help others flourish, binding their injuries and making them whole, or to steal their vital essence, ripping the life from them to watch as they wither and die.', 1, NULL, '{"rows":[{"index":0,"costs":[15,0,0,0],"spans":[4,0,0,0],"abilities":["HEHARESPEC","HEHARESPEC","HEHARESPEC","HEHARESPEC"],"directions":[{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":1,"costs":[5,15,15,10],"spans":[1,1,1,1],"abilities":["HEALMAG","SYMSPI","CONCONSU","HEALRANGE"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":2,"costs":[10,0,10,15],"spans":[2,0,1,1],"abilities":["EMPMEDI","EMPMEDI","HEALSTRENGTH","HEALSPEED"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":true,"right":false}]},{"index":3,"costs":[15,10,0,10],"spans":[1,2,0,1],"abilities":["HEALMAGIMP","HEALDURATION","HEALDURATION","HEALRANGEIMP"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":true,"right":false}]},{"index":4,"costs":[15,0,20,0],"spans":[2,0,2,0],"abilities":["MENDMUT","MENDMUT","HEALMASTERY","HEALMASTERY"],"directions":[{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false}]}]}'::jsonb, 'respec', false) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, ability_tree = EXCLUDED.ability_tree;


[P]Those who count the Force as their ally can use the Force to imbue their allies in turn. They can rest their hand on a friend''s shoulder or arm, or even just stand beside an ally as a solid, reassuring presence. As they reach out to touch the Force, they channel the power given to them through their bodies and out again, flowing into the nearby ally. Imbued allies may accomplish great and terrible feats, jumping higher, thinking faster, and striking harder with the Force. An ally need not even be able to touch the Force normally, for the Force flows through all living things.', 1, NULL, '{"rows":[{"index":0,"costs":[10,0,0,0],"spans":[4,0,0,0],"abilities":["IMBUEBPRE","IMBUEBPRE","IMBUEBPRE","IMBUEBPRE"],"directions":[{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":1,"costs":[5,10,10,10],"spans":[1,1,1,1],"abilities":["IMBRANGE","IMBSTRENGTH","PROWEAK","IMBMAGNITUDE"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":2,"costs":[15,10,0,10],"spans":[1,2,0,1],"abilities":["IMBRANGEIMP","TRANSFERENCE","TRANSFERENCE","IMBDURATION"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":true,"right":false}]},{"index":3,"costs":[15,0,10,0],"spans":[2,0,2,0],"abilities":["GUIDEBEREFT","GUIDEBEREFT","IMBSPEED","IMBSPEED"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":true,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":4,"costs":[10,20,0,20],"spans":[1,2,0,1],"abilities":["IMBSTRENGTHIMP","IMBMASTERY","IMBMASTERY","IMBDURATIONIMP"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":true,"right":false}]}]}'::jsonb, 'respec', false) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, ability_tree = EXCLUDED.ability_tree;

The ability to influence the minds of others is not something to be taken lightly. Misuse of the ability, colloquially known as a "mind trick," is a sure step on the path to the dark side. A powerful Force user can manipulate the minds of others to the point where he can convince them to believe things that are untrue, or calm an angry crowd. Conversely, he can rile the crowd into a murderous frenzy, or frighten a single soul into gibbering madness. This is where the danger of Influence lies.

[P]However, Influence is not inherently evil. Many Force users have used Influence to protect the helpless or to deal with a threat in a way that avoids violence. It is much better to convince a guard to return to his post than to have to kill him.', 1, NULL, '{"rows":[{"index":0,"costs":[10,0,0,0],"spans":[4,0,0,0],"abilities":["INFLUBPRE","INFLUBPRE","INFLUBPRE","INFLUBPRE"],"directions":[{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":1,"costs":[0,5,5,5],"spans":[1,1,1,1],"abilities":["RANGEINFRE","MAGINRE","CAPTIINFLUNCERE","SUBDUEUPLIFT"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":2,"costs":[10,0,5,15],"spans":[2,0,1,1],"abilities":["BEGUILINFLUENCERE","BEGUILINFLUENCERE","ENTINRE","DURATIONINRE"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":true,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":3,"costs":[5,10,10,10],"spans":[1,1,1,1],"abilities":["COMMANDINRE","MAGINIMPRE","INFRANGEIMPRE","CLOUDEDMINDRE"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":true,"right":false}]},{"index":4,"costs":[5,10,20,0],"spans":[1,1,2,0],"abilities":["MENACINGINFLUENCE","STRENGTHINFRE","MASTERYINFRE","MASTERYINFRE"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":true,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false}]}]}'::jsonb, 'respec', 