Insight differs from many other prophetic abilities in that it focuses very narrowly on a specific person. At the most basic level, it observes not the future of the cosmos but the fate of a particular individual. However, even these hints that Insight grants are only likelihoods. The future is volatile, shifting with the choices of individuals. Even the decision whether or not to act on these visions of possible futures can alter results they foreshadowed.', 1, NULL, '{"rows":[{"index":0,"costs":[10,0,0,0],"spans":[4,0,0,0],"abilities":["INSIGHTBPRE","INSIGHTBPRE","INSIGHTBPRE","INSIGHTBPRE"],"directions":[{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":1,"costs":[5,10,10,0],"spans":[1,1,2,0],"abilities":["INSIGHTRANGE","BACKFOOT","EMPOWEREDINIT","EMPOWEREDINIT"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":2,"costs":[5,10,10,5],"spans":[1,1,1,1],"abilities":["INSIGHTDURATION","INSIGHTSTRENGTH","SHAREDINIT","INSIGHTMAGNITUDE"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":true,"right":false}]},{"index":3,"costs":[10,10,10,10],"spans":[1,1,1,1],"abilities":["INSIGHTRANGEIMP","STEPAHEAD","INSIGHTSPEED","INSIGHTMAGIMP"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":true,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":4,"costs":[20,0,20,0],"spans":[2,0,2,0],"abilities":["INSIGHTMASTERY","INSIGHTMASTERY","SEIZEMOMENT","SEIZEMOMENT"],"directions":[{"up