Warde’s Foresight differs from many other prophetic abilities in that it focuses very narrowly on a specific person. At the most basic level, it observes not the future of the cosmos but the fate of a particular individual. However, even these hints that Warde’s power of prophecy grants are only likelihoods. The future is volatile, shifting with the choices of individuals. Even the decision whether or not to act on these visions of possible futures can alter results they foreshadowed.
[P]The basic power has one way to spend Force points: the user may spend [FP] to gain hints about what an individual within short range is likely to do in the near future. In structured gameplay, this knowledge does not typically extend beyond the end of the current encounter.', 1, NULL, '{"rows":[{"index":0,"costs":[10,0,0,5],"spans":[3,0,0,1],"abilities":["WARFORBASIC","WARFORBASIC","WARFORBASIC"],"directions":[{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":1,"costs":[5,10,0,0],"spans":[1,3,0,0],"abilities":["WARFORRANGE","WARFORCONTROL1","WARFORCONTROL1","WARFORCONTROL1"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":2,"costs":[10,10,10,10],"spans":[1,1,1,1],"abilities":["WARFORSTRENGTH","WARFORCONTROL2","WARFORDURATION","WARFORDURATION"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":true,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":3,"costs":[5,10,15,10],"spans":[1,1,1,1],"abilities":["WARFORRANGE","WARFORDURATION","WARFORCONTROL3","WARFORMAGNITUDE"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":true,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":true,"right":false}]},{"index":4,"costs":[10,15,0,0],"spans":[1,3,0,0],"abilities":["WARFORSTRENGTH","WARFORCONTROL4","WARFORCONTROL4","WARFORCONTROL4"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false}]}]}'::jsonb, 'respec', false) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, ability_tree = EXCLUDED.ability_tree;
Jerserra combined her Inquisitor''s strict training with her guidance from her shard of the Nardithi Cluster and found a way to project fear onto her foes. Other Force users, through encountering Jerserra and her power, can learn to do the same.
[P]The user may spend [FP] to target one character within short range. That character must immediately make an [B]Average ([DI][DI]) fear check as an out of turn incidental. The user may not activate this multiple times.', 1, NULL, '{"rows":[{"index":0,"costs":[10,0,0,0],"spans":[4,0,0,0],"abilities":["JERINFBASIC","JERINFBASIC","JERINFBASIC","JERINFBASIC"],"directions":[{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":1,"costs":[5,10,0,0],"spans":[1,3,0,0],"abilities":["JERINFRANGE","JERINFSTRENGTH","JERINFSTRENGTH","JERINFSTRENGTH"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":false,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false}]},{"index":2,"costs":[10,10,10,10],"spans":[1,1,1,1],"abilities":["JERINFCONTROL1","JERINFRANGE","JERINFCONTROL2","JERINFMAGNITUDE"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":true,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":true,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":true,"left":true,"right":false}]},{"index":3,"costs":[10,10,15,15],"spans":[1,1,1,1],"abilities":["JERINFMAGNITUDE","JERINFSTRENGTH","JERINFCONTROL3","JERINFRANGE"],"directions":[{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":true,"right":false},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":true,"left":true,"right":false}]},{"index":4,"costs":[15,0,5,0],"spans":[2,0,2,0],"abilities":["JERINFMASTERY1","JERINFMASTERY1","JERINFMASTERY2","JERINFMASTERY2"],"directions":[{"up":false,"down":false,"left":false,"right":true},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":true,"right":true},{"up":false,"down":false,"left":true,"right":false},{"up":true,"down":false,"left":false,"right":false}]}]}'::jsonb, 