[P]The user may spend [FP] to remove [SE] equal the user’s Force rating from combat checks made against personal-scale targets imposed due to defense, concealment, cover until the end of the user’s next turn. Alternatively, the user may spend [FP][FP] to remove [SE] equal to the user’s Force rating from combat checks made against starships and vehicles until the end of the user’s next turn.', 'SEEK', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P]Alternatively, as an action, the user may make an [B]opposed Computers[b] or [B]Mechanics vs Discipline check[b] targeting a droid, making a combined Dismantle force check as part of the pool. If successful and the droid is within range of the power, the user may spend [FP][FP] to stagger or immobilize it until the end of its next turn, and may spend [FP] to change its short term memory, per GM discretion.', 'MANIPULATE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
