[P][B]Exhaust:[b] Once per encounter, if no [LI] were used, one target decreases each characteristic by 1 instead.', 'IMBUE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;

[P][B]Imbue:[b] The user may spend [FP] to increase a single characteristic of an engaged character by 1 (to a maximum of 6) until the end of the Force user''s next turn. This can only be used once per character per encounter. If the user uses [DA] to generate [FP], the target increases a second characteristic by 1 (to a maximum of 6) until the end of the user''s next turn, but both user and target suffer 2 strain.
[P][B]Exhaust:[b] The user may spend [FP] to decrease one characteristic of an engaged foe by 1 (to a minimum of 1) until the end of the user''s next turn. This can only be used once per character per encounter. If the user uses [DA] to generate [FP], the target decreases a second characteristic by 1 (to a minimum of 1) until the end of the user''s next turn, but the user suffers 2 strain.', 'IMBUE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]Exhaust:[b] The user may spend [FP] to reduce the target’s ranks of a single skill by half, rounded down, while the target is affected by this power. The skill must be linked to the characteristic decreased by this power.', 'IMBUE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P]The user may spend [FP] to make a target who is affected by the Force, and is within short range, unable to see or hear a chosen person or object of silhouette 1 or smaller. Until the beginning of the user’s next turn, the target cannot see or sense the hidden person or object. The user acts as if they are Blinded when attacking or attempting to perceive the hidden person or object.', 'MISDIRECT', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P]If no [DA] were spent to generate [FP], the target cannot activate Force powers, force talents, or commit [FO] until the end of their next turn. 
[P]If no [LI] were spent to generate [FP], the user increases their Force rating by a number equal to the number of [FO] uncommitted this way until the end of their next turn.', 'SUPPRESS', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;

[P][B]Light Side User:[b] If that foe used [DA] to generate [FP] on the check, they suffer strain equal to the user’s ranks in Discipline.

[P][B]Dark Side User:[b] The Force user may suffer 2 strain to remove rolled [LI] up to the user’s Discipline and add that many [DA]. The user gains 2 Conflict.', 'SUPPRESS', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;

[P]The Force user may spend [FP] to add automatic [FA] to hostile Force power checks made against them or any ally within short range until the end of their next turn.', 'SUPPRESS', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]Horrify:[b] When activating Strength, instead increase the difficulty of the fear check twice.
[P]Additionally, when activating Empowered Will, the user may spend [FP][FP] to add [SU][AD] to the check(s), and may do so multiple times.', 'VALORHORRIFY', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]Horrify:[b] If the user used no [LI] to generate [FP], each target that fails the fear check caused by this power, or is successfully coerced by a combined Coercion Force power check, loses their free maneuver while suffering the effects of failing that check. This effect ends when the encounter ends or the effects of fear end.', 'VALORHORRIFY', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]Horrify:[b] Spend [FP] to increase the difficulty of fear check caused by this power once.', 'VALORHORRIFY', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]Horrify:[b] Foes within short range upgrade the difficulty of fear checks a number of times equal to half the user''s Force rating, rounded up. This includes mundane fear checks and force checks instigated by sources other than the user.', 'VALORHORRIFY', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]Horrify:[b] Once per session after a foe fails a fear check caused by this power, the user may have them perform an action as an out of turn incidental. The user gains 3 conflict.', 'VALORHORRIFY', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]Horrify:[b] If a target suffers strain from fear caused by this power, the user may recover that much strain and gain 1 conflict.', 'VALORHORRIFY', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]Valor:[b] Once per round as a maneuver, the user may spend [FP] to assist an ally within short range through the Force, assisting the ally until the user''s never turn. This counts as unskilled assistance, but may be considered skilled assistance, per GM discretion.
[P][B]Horrify:[b] The user may spend [FP] to force a character within short range to immediately make an [B]Average ([DI][DI]) fear check.[b] The user gains 1 conflict.', 'VALORHORRIFY', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]Horrify:[b] When making a Coercion check, the user may make a Horrify check as part of the pool. The user may spend [FP] to add [SU] and/or [AD] to the check, but may only add each symbol once.', 'VALORHORRIFY', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]With Nature:[b] Once per turn when activating Magnitude, the user may gain additional senses or ask additional questions equal to the user’s Force rating instead.', 'COMMUNE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P]Additionally, if the user successfully activated the Command Creature upgrade, the user may issue a command by performing a maneuver, which they will abide by immediately by performing a maneuver and taking an action.', 'COMMUNE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]With Nature:[b] The user may spend [FO] or to gain additional information when communing from nature, or ask an additional question.', 'COMMUNE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]With Creatures:[b] The user may spend [FP] to learn the emotional state and disposition of one non-sentient creature within short range. Disposition ranges from friendly, to neutral, to hostile. Emotional state runs the gamut of possible sentient experience, in a simpler form.
[P][B]With Nature:[b] The user may spend [FP] to gain sensory information or general insight from nature within short range. The GM delivers a brief sense or single feeling that the natural world wishes to impart.', 'COMMUNE', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;
[P][B]Special Rule ([LI]/[DA] use):[b] When experiencing emotions, only [FP] generated from [DA] may be used to experience negative emotions such as rage or fear. Only [FP] generated from [LI] may be used to experience positive emotions such as selflessness or joy. Both can be used to experience other emotions such as confusion.
[P]The user may spend [FP] to sense a distorted and brief image, sounds, or emotion from a previous event or person that happened in the immediate area or involved an engaged object. The event or person, and the age of the experience, is per GM discretion.', 'PSYCHOMETRY', 'respec', false, 1, NULL) ON CONFLICT (key, dataset_source) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name, description = EXCLUDED.description, power_key = EXCLUDED.power_key;

-- Recalculate pip_cost for all reSpec force abilities (same formula as migration 060/079)
UPDATE ref_force_abilities
SET pip_cost = GREATEST(
  1,
  (
    CHAR_LENGTH(COALESCE(description, ''))
    - CHAR_LENGTH(REPLACE(COALESCE(description, ''), '[FP]', ''))
  ) / 4
)
WHERE dataset_source = 'respec';

